sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant D as CKA dojo
  participant C as Curriculum store
  participant K as Disposable cluster
  U->>D: Request a practice drill
  D->>C: Select a weak topic
  C-->>D: Scenario and checks
  D->>K: Prepare temporary exercise
  U->>K: Solve with kubectl
  K-->>D: Verification result
  D-->>U: Score and explanation
